Composition. The members of the National Steering
Committee shall be the following agencies:
Vice-Chairman :
: Presidential Adviser on the Peace Process
Chairperson of the Philippine Commission On
Women, as Vice-Chairman
Secretary of National Defense;
Secretary of Social Welfare and Development;
Secretary of Justice;
Secretary of Interior and Local Government;
Secretary of Foreign Affairs;
Chairperson of the National Commission on
Indigenous Peoples; and,
Head of the Office on Muslim Affairs.
